WEBVTT

00:07:58.284 --> 00:08:00.388
down the street from their house.

00:08:01.128 --> 00:08:03.764
Forty dollars.

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:07.178
The police watched the deal go down.

00:08:08.420 --> 00:08:11.680
They could've arrested the buyer
and confiscated the drugs,

00:08:11.704 --> 00:08:13.090
but they didn't.

00:08:13.826 --> 00:08:15.989
They could've arrested
the Sourovelises' son

00:08:16.013 --> 00:08:17.429
right there on the street

00:08:17.453 --> 00:08:19.312
and grabbed 40 dollars.

00:08:20.017 --> 00:08:21.209
But they didn't.

00:08:21.991 --> 00:08:24.207
They waited to arrest him at home,

00:08:24.231 --> 00:08:27.298
because then they could seize
their entire house.

00:08:28.567 --> 00:08:31.933
The house was worth 350,000 dollars.